{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$@ %2$lld/%3$lld": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ %2$lld/%3$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$@ AI评分完成：AI 推荐保留 %2$lld 张。请逐张查看后用底部的“采纳”确认。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ AI scoring complete: AI suggests keeping %2$lld photos. Review them, then confirm with Accept at the bottom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$@ AI评分完成：AI 推荐保留 %2$lld 张；%3$lld 张同场景重复已顺延。请逐张查看后用底部的“采纳”确认。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ AI scoring complete: AI suggests keeping %2$lld photos; %3$lld same-scene duplicates were skipped. Review them, then confirm with Accept at the bottom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$@中有 %2$lld 组相似照片被同时保留，请每组只留一张。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ has %2$lld sets of similar photos kept together; keep only one from each set."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$@保留数已达目标 %2$lld 张，无需再评分。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ already reached its target of %2$lld kept photos, so scoring isn't needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$@第 %2$lld 名 · AI 推荐保留": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ rank %2$lld · AI suggests keeping"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$lld 张已按分数排序，AI 推荐保留其中 %2$lld 张。逐张看过后，用底部的“采纳”确认。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld photos ranked by score; AI suggests keeping %2$lld of them. Review them, then confirm with Accept at the bottom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ AI评分": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ AI Scoring"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ AI评分完成": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ AI scoring complete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ AI评分已完成；网格已切到“已AI评分”，可逐张查看后采纳。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ AI scoring is complete. The grid switched to AI Scored so you can review each photo and then accept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ AI评分已开始：共 %lld 张；限流或网络中断会自动退避重试，仍失败则停在当前进度。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ AI Scoring has started for %2$lld photos. Rate limits and network drops are retried automatically with backoff; if they persist, scoring stops at the current progress."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ API Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ API Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %lld 张": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ · %2$lld photos"
