      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Model ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 不建立用户账号，不收集位置、联系人或设备广告标识，不做跨 App 或网站跟踪。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app does not create user accounts, collect location, contacts, or advertising identifiers, or track across apps or websites."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 将复制人物 %1$lld 张、风景 %2$lld 张，并分别放入两个子目录；不会移动或删除原图。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app will copy %1$lld People photos and %2$lld Scenery photos into two subfolders. Originals are never moved or deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 将复制人物 %lld 张、风景 %lld 张，并分别放入两个子目录；不会移动或删除原图。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app will copy %1$lld People photos and %2$lld Scenery photos into separate folders. Originals will not be moved or deleted."
