    },
    "MiniMax Token Plan 当前未接受请求（HTTP %lld）。这通常表示 5 小时额度、周额度或动态限流；请在 MiniMax 套餐用量中检查可用资源，或至少等待 1 分钟后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MiniMax Token Plan is not accepting this request (HTTP %lld). This usually means the five-hour quota, weekly quota, or dynamic rate limit is active. Check available resources in MiniMax plan usage, or wait at least one minute before retrying."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“验证并保存”和“验证已保存的 Key”会向所选模型发送 1 张内置测试图，测试图不来自你的照片；“刷新账号模型”只读取 OpenAI / Anthropic 账号可见的模型 ID，不发送图片，也不保存模型列表。两者都只在你点击时发生。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Verify and save” and “Verify saved key” send one built-in test image to the selected model; the test image never comes from your photos. “Refresh account models” only reads the model IDs visible to your OpenAI / Anthropic account — it sends no images and stores no model list. Both happen only when you click them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
