    "将仅在内存中生成并发送 %lld 张%@无元数据 JPEG 预览到 %@，交由%@逐张独立评分。不会发送原始文件、文件名、本地路径或 EXIF/GPS。更大的预览可能增加上传量、等待时间和供应商费用；AI评分不会替你保留或淘汰照片。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld metadata-free JPEG previews at %2$@ will be created in memory and sent to %3$@ for independent scoring by %4$@. Original files, filenames, local paths, and EXIF/GPS are not sent. Larger previews may increase upload size, wait time, and provider charges. AI scoring never keeps or rejects photos for you."
          }
