            "value": "This Mac stores only secure bookmarks, project names, photo counts, People/Scenery targets, decisions by relative path, user classification corrections, and the current selection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次 AI 调用：输入 %lld tokens。费用以所选供应商账单为准。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI usage: %1$lld input tokens. See the selected provider's bill for cost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次 AI 调用：输入 %lld tokens，输出 %lld tokens。费用以所选供应商账单为准。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI usage: %1$lld input tokens and %2$lld output tokens. See the selected provider's bill for cost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次 AI 调用：输出 %lld tokens。费用以所选供应商账单为准。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI usage: %1$lld output tokens. See the selected provider's bill for cost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次全部为人物照片。重点观察人物表情、姿态、互动、遮挡、人物清晰度和人物与环境的关系；风景只作为人物叙事背景。不得推断身份或敏感属性。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All photos in this request are People photos. Focus on expression, pose, interaction, occlusion, subject clarity, and the relationship between people and their surroundings. Treat scenery only as narrative context, and do not infer identity or sensitive attributes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次全部为风景照片。重点观察空间层次、构图、光线、氛围和地点叙事；不得因为画面中没有人物而降低分数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All photos in this request are Scenery photos. Focus on depth, composition, light, atmosphere, and sense of place. Do not lower a score because no person is present."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次未指定人物或风景类型；只按照片自身内容使用固定标尺评分。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No People or Scenery type was specified. Score only the photo itself using the fixed scale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本轮：输入 %lld tokens，输出 %lld tokens。费用以所选供应商账单为准。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This run: %1$lld input tokens and %2$lld output tokens. See the selected provider's bill for cost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "权限失效时，点按项目并重新选择对应文件夹；App 不会尝试绕过系统授权。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
