          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "模型列表请求未成功（HTTP %1$lld%2$@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型按固定绝对标尺对每张照片独立评分，不做组内比较，也不返回名次。全部完成后只在人物或风景内按统一分数排序，取该类型前 N 张作为推荐结果；是否保留由你用底部的“采纳”确认。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model scores each photo independently on one fixed scale, without comparing photos in a request and without returning ranks. When a run finishes, the app sorts within People or Scenery and takes the top N as suggestions; whether to keep them is confirmed by you with Accept at the bottom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型返回了响应，但未通过照片评分契约校验。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model responded, but its output did not pass the photo scoring contract."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在为%@照片评分": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
