    "评分": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Score"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "评分与排序": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scoring and ranking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "评分只提供解释和排序；用底部的“采纳”确认最终结果。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scoring only explains and ranks. Use Accept at the bottom to confirm the final result."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "评分图片只发送给本次选择的火山方舟、MiniMax、OpenAI、Anthropic、Google、阿里云百炼、xAI、Kimi、智谱、腾讯混元或自定义兼容接口。供应商可通过你的 API Key 将调用关联到对应账号；同一组照片不会同时发送给多个服务。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scoring images are sent only to the selected Volcano Ark, MiniMax, OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Alibaba Model Studio, xAI, Kimi, Zhipu, Tencent Hunyuan, or custom compatible endpoint. The provider can associate requests with your account through your API key. The same photos are never sent to multiple services at once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "评分图片尺寸": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scoring Image Size"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "评分已查看，继续": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Score Reviewed, Continue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "评分模型": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scoring Model"
          }
        }
      }
