    },
    "请先在“照片类型”中选择人物或风景，再开始该类型的 AI评分。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose People or Scenery under Photo Type before starting AI Scoring for that type."
          }
        }
