    },
    "请先在照片类型中选择“人物”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose People under Photo Type first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先打开一张照片检查大图。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open a photo to inspect the large preview."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先选中一张相似照片。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select a similar photo first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请求之间保持自适应间隔；限流、服务端故障和网络中断会自动退避重试，每张最多 4 次并产生额外请求与费用，仍失败时停在当前照片范围供你重试或放弃。鉴权和模型 ID 错误不会重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requests keep an adaptive interval. Rate limits, server failures, and dropped connections retry automatically with backoff — up to 4 times per photo, each costing an extra request — and if they still fail the run stops at the current photo range so you can retry or abandon it. Authentication and model-ID errors are never retried."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请等待当前分析完成，或先停止 AI 任务，再切换项目。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wait for analysis to finish, or stop the AI task before switching projects."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请等待当前分析完成，或先停止 AI 任务，再删除项目。": {
